The Endless Yes.

Romeo, a young man with a loud voice.
Juliet, a lady who never grows tired.

Act I: Yes, forever.

Scene I: The meeting.

[Enter Romeo and Juliet]

Scene II: The cry.

Romeo:
  You are as good as a big big big big big big cat.
  You are as good as the sum of you and a big big big big big cat.
  You are as good as the sum of you and a big big big big cat.
  You are as good as the sum of you and a big big big cat.
  You are as good as the sum of you and a cat.
  Speak your mind!
  You are as good as a big big big cat.
  You are as good as the sum of you and a big cat.
  Speak your mind!
  Let us return to scene II.
